WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
Welcome to Grade 1 English, Unit 2: Family Time.

2
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.800
In this unit you will learn the
words for the people in your family.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.780
They are mum, dad, sister, brother, grandma and grandpa.

4
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.640
You will learn some breakfast and fruit words too.

5
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.740
You will count from 1 to 10.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.180
You will talk about who is in your family.

7
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.580
You will talk about how families help each other and have fun.

8
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.280
Say the words out loud.

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.160
This is about talking with confidence, not perfect spelling.

10
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:35.080
In this short lecture, preview the key
ideas and prepare for the independent lesson.

11
00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:42.060
By the end of this unit, you will be able to name the
people in a family (mother, father, sister, brother, grandma,

12
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:42.980
grandpa, baby).

13
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:49.300
You will also name some breakfast foods and fruits
(pancakes, cereal, milk, mango, banana, grapes).

14
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:54.500
You will also count from 1 to 10,
and count backwards from 10 to 1.

15
00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.570
Keep these goals in mind as you work.

16
00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:03.280
Your vocabulary work begins with these
words: egg, hen, bed, pen, wet, ten.

17
00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:08.640
Listen to each word, look at what it means,
and try to use it when you talk and write.

18
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:13.980
The reading sequence includes Breakfast at
Grandma's House and Talk about Family Time.

19
00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:19.580
Read slowly, look at the pictures,
and find the big idea in each text.

20
00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:23.740
When you answer a question, point to the words that show it.

21
00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:27.900
The first language focus is Introduce a family member.

22
00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:31.320
Show a family photo or drawing and say who it is.

23
00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.720
The word 'my' shows they belong to your family.

24
00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:38.760
Look at the examples, then try
the pattern in your own sentences.

25
00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:43.080
In speaking, you will complete Speaking 1 - Listen and point.

26
00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.540
Say your ideas clearly and listen to your partner.

27
00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:53.420
In writing, you will draw, trace, copy or write,
then check your work with a grown-up or the AI tutor.

28
00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:55.080
You are ready to begin.

29
00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:01.240
Start with the words, then the reading and the
questions, then the grammar, speaking and writing.

30
00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:07.280
Ask the AI tutor for help any time, and bring your
questions to a live session too if you join one.
